ow power consumption, and robust temperature stability, making it ideal for telecom networks, ISPs, and enterprise fiber deployments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Data Rate: 1.25Gbps (symmetrical)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Distance: Up to 20km over single-mode fiber</span></li><li>Connector Type: SC/UPC</li><li>Wavelength: 1490nm (TX) / 1310nm (RX)</li><li>Compatible with EPON OLT equipment</li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">PX20+++ Standard for extended reach and high performance</span></li><li>Hot-Pluggable SFP Form Factor</li><li>Ideal for FTTH, ISP, and Metro Access Networks</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL GPON OLT PON SFP Module 2.5G C++++ 9dBm","href":"/vsol-gpon-pon-sfp-module-25g-c-9dbm","now":"2,300৳","old":"2,800৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM GPON OLT PON SFP Module 2.5G C++++ 9dBm","href":"/ecom-gpon-olt-pon-sfp-module-25g-c-9dbm","now":"2,500৳","old":"2,800৳","single":""},{"name":"D CORE EPON OLT PON SFP Module E14D9PX20 Optical Transceiver","href":"/dcore-epon-olt-pon-sfp-module-e14d9px20-optical-transceiver","now":"1,900৳","old":"2,000৳","single":""},{"name":"D CORE GPON OLT PON SFP Module G14D9C+++ High-Power Class C+++ GPON Transceiver","href":"/dcore-gpon-olt-pon-sfp-module-g14d9c-high-power-class-c-gpon-transceiver","now":"2,000৳","old":"2,100৳","single":""},{"name":"D CORE OT-XS1000G XPON SFP ONU Stick","href":"/dcore-ot-xs1000g-xpon-sfp-onu-stick","now":"","old":"","single":"4,200৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/ecom-e01gp-s-1-pon-port-gpon-olt","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Ecom/E01GP-S+-(1)-1-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"ECOM E01GP-S+ 1-PO